### M6 — Android composer: recording strip, hold survives system cancel

While listening, the composer's pill shows a recording strip — a level wave flowing out of the mic, the elapsed time and, in the last 30 s, a red countdown — with the placeholder and the camera button hidden; a system-cancelled hold turns into a locked take.

**Scope** — new `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/ui/chat/RecordingStrip.kt`; `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/ui/chat/Composer.kt`; `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/ui/chat/MicButton.kt`; `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/ui/chat/ChatScreen.kt`; tests `android/app/src/test/java/dev/hermespet/ComposerTest.kt`, `android/app/src/test/java/dev/hermespet/MicButtonTest.kt`, `android/app/src/test/java/dev/hermespet/ChatScreenShotTest.kt`; goldens `android/app/src/test/screenshots/chat-listening.png` (changes), new `android/app/src/test/screenshots/chat-recording-limit.png`.

