# M03: Core: microphone and link kept for a take in the background

## Tasks

When the app leaves the foreground while a take records, the capture stays open and the gateway link stays unparked until the take's turn is over; otherwise the background behaviour is unchanged.

**Scope** — `client/internal/audio/aaudio_android.go`, `client/internal/audio/gate.go`, `client/internal/audio/gate_test.go`, `client/cmd/petcore/core.go`, `client/cmd/petcore/jni.go`, `client/cmd/petcore/core_test.go`.

